{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Dreams Far Away&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a first-person platformer experience for up to 8 players. After a mutated rabies virus began to threaten life on Earth, humanity found a solution by relocating to safe cities built in the sky. You and other players must make your way through dangerous, crumbling structures \u2014 leaping over obstacles, jumping across tall buildings and walls \u2014 all in an effort to reach the skybound safe city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this platforming adventure where you race against time, each jump tests your agility and reflexes, bringing you one step closer to survival. &quot;This is my learning project.&quot;</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844340?t=1768514401","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844340?t=1768514401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844340/5edec9e375d8f51084e20bba88a2f38641a1396f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768514401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844340/5edec9e375d8f51084e20bba88a2f38641a1396f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768514401","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Dreams Far Away&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a first-person platformer experience for up to 8 players. After a mutated rabies virus began to threaten life on Earth, humanity found a solution by relocating to sa